# UI

- Use shadcn/ui as the base component set.
- Keep forms and tables consistent (shared Form + DataTable patterns).
- **Mobile-first, fully responsive (locked):** owner/staff use phones as primary device. Design and QA at ~375px first; desktop is progressive enhancement. Touch targets ≥44px on primary actions; sticky bottom CTAs on sale punch; no hover-only critical paths.
- Counter billing: **Quick Sale** (`/sales/quick`) is the lightning path (create+post); keep draft form for complex bills. See ADR-012 / ADR-013 in `docs/architecture.md`.
- Maintain WCAG AA accessibility.
- Enterprise minimal look: no purple gradients, no marketing heroes, no emoji icons (use lucide).
- Follow `docs/design.md` tokens (teal accent, IBM Plex / Source Sans).
